*slice* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''slice(container, start, end)''

Extracts a sub-range from a string, bytes, or list. The range is inclusive on both ends. ''end'' is clamped to the container length; returns an empty value of the same type if ''start'' > length or ''end'' < ''start''.

*Parameters:*
- ''container'': String, bytes, or list to slice
- ''start'': Start position
- ''end'': End position

*Returns:*
- Same type as ''container'': Sub-range from ''start'' to ''end''

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if ''container'' is not a string, bytes, or list
- Runtime error if ''start'' or ''end'' is not a number
- Runtime error if ''start'' is less than 1
